{"5049720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anurak", "steam_appid": 5049720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows <strong>Piker</strong>, an investigative journalist from Los Angeles, who travels to Machu Picchu after hearing rumors of a newly discovered hidden passage leading to underground caves. The year is 1981.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon arriving at Machu Picchu, Piker crawls through a narrow stone crevice that leads to a part of the site closed to the public. His curiosity draws him toward an ancient pyramid. Something doesn't feel right, but he continues.     <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/fa98544f9f5ebc5a90715c4e1089b72b.poster.avif?t=1786641017\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/fa98544f9f5ebc5a90715c4e1089b72b.webm?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/fa98544f9f5ebc5a90715c4e1089b72b.mp4?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the role of an investigative journalist. Explore the secrets beneath Machu Picchu and document your findings using your reporting equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/353c38c8d18916407acead0119b5d87a.poster.avif?t=1786641017\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/353c38c8d18916407acead0119b5d87a.webm?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/353c38c8d18916407acead0119b5d87a.mp4?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the darkness using only your flashlight. Search abandoned tunnels, and stay alert as the caves become increasingly hostile.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/c27b2d1afcd706a17f45b216a49f5b8a.poster.avif?t=1786641017\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/c27b2d1afcd706a17f45b216a49f5b8a.webm?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/c27b2d1afcd706a17f45b216a49f5b8a.mp4?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles to uncover hidden paths, unlock forgotten passages, and progress deeper into the ancient cave system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/bdfb73eca1c140807c965a5501e342a5.poster.avif?t=1786641017\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/bdfb73eca1c140807c965a5501e342a5.webm?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/bdfb73eca1c140807c965a5501e342a5.mp4?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underground caves beneath Machu Picchu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient relics and hidden passageways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles to unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive sound design and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person psychological horror.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows <strong>Piker</strong>, an investigative journalist from Los Angeles, who travels to Machu Picchu after hearing rumors of a newly discovered hidden passage leading to underground caves. The year is 1981.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon arriving at Machu Picchu, Piker crawls through a narrow stone crevice that leads to a part of the site closed to the public. His curiosity draws him toward an ancient pyramid. Something doesn't feel right, but he continues.     <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/fa98544f9f5ebc5a90715c4e1089b72b.poster.avif?t=1786641017\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/fa98544f9f5ebc5a90715c4e1089b72b.webm?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/fa98544f9f5ebc5a90715c4e1089b72b.mp4?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the role of an investigative journalist. Explore the secrets beneath Machu Picchu and document your findings using your reporting equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/353c38c8d18916407acead0119b5d87a.poster.avif?t=1786641017\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/353c38c8d18916407acead0119b5d87a.webm?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/353c38c8d18916407acead0119b5d87a.mp4?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the darkness using only your flashlight. Search abandoned tunnels, and stay alert as the caves become increasingly hostile.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/c27b2d1afcd706a17f45b216a49f5b8a.poster.avif?t=1786641017\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/c27b2d1afcd706a17f45b216a49f5b8a.webm?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/c27b2d1afcd706a17f45b216a49f5b8a.mp4?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles to uncover hidden paths, unlock forgotten passages, and progress deeper into the ancient cave system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/bdfb73eca1c140807c965a5501e342a5.poster.avif?t=1786641017\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/bdfb73eca1c140807c965a5501e342a5.webm?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/extras/bdfb73eca1c140807c965a5501e342a5.mp4?t=1786641017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underground caves beneath Machu Picchu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient relics and hidden passageways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles to unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive sound design and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person psychological horror.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Psychological first-person horror about an investigative journalist exploring hidden caves beneath Machu Picchu. Document your findings, and uncover what lies beneath.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/c5ca950f4f0f7d6a835395967288f0fae83ef30a/header.jpg?t=1786641017", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/03280728de9179442dca0bfba9bdb42921ef3147/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786641017", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049720/03280728de9179442dca0bfba9bdb42921ef3147/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786641017", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-3470 or AMD™ Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb